<title>UK: INSIGHT-Coffee likely to test downside.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Coffee likely to test downside.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SEPT	Close  * Support * Resist * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA40</p>
<p> COFFEE    1,798  *  1,780  *  1,855 *   44  *  1,815 *  1,953</p>
<p>---------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - JULY 7----------------</p>
<p>Robusta coffee futures are likely to break out of a chart pennant to test the downside amid a lack of trading volume, analysts said on Monday.</p>
<p>Traders called the market to open unchanged.</p>
<p>The New York arabica market was closed on Friday for the U.S. Independence Day holiday.</p>
